{"4112620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flapverse", "steam_appid": 4112620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flapverse is a dynamic 2D arcade game that tells the stories of different birds, each revealing how difficult the struggle for survival can be. Guide every bird through beautiful yet hostile worlds, stay in control of their flight, and find a path through treacherous traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112620/extras/c779b6c81e460b37f182302c8543f32f.poster.avif?t=1787040977\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112620/extras/c779b6c81e460b37f182302c8543f32f.webm?t=1787040977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112620/extras/c779b6c81e460b37f182302c8543f32f.mp4?t=1787040977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY WORLD IS A NEW CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level changes not only the scenery but also the nature of the journey. Colorful landscapes give way to dark caves and the cold reaches of space, while each environment introduces new mechanics, obstacles, and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DANGER TAKES MANY FORMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar flight path can change at any moment. Moving machinery, predatory creatures, tentacles, and unusual anomalies will demand quick reactions, precise actions, and adaptability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic arcade flight with precise controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse 2D worlds, each with its own atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different mechanics and types of danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics that affect the bird’s movement and controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics and expressive visual effects.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flapverse is a dynamic 2D arcade game that tells the stories of different birds, each revealing how difficult the struggle for survival can be. Guide every bird through beautiful yet hostile worlds, stay in control of their flight, and find a path through treacherous traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112620/extras/c779b6c81e460b37f182302c8543f32f.poster.avif?t=1787040977\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112620/extras/c779b6c81e460b37f182302c8543f32f.webm?t=1787040977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4112620/extras/c779b6c81e460b37f182302c8543f32f.mp4?t=1787040977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY WORLD IS A NEW CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level changes not only the scenery but also the nature of the journey. Colorful landscapes give way to dark caves and the cold reaches of space, while each environment introduces new mechanics, obstacles, and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DANGER TAKES MANY FORMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar flight path can change at any moment. Moving machinery, predatory creatures, tentacles, and unusual anomalies will demand quick reactions, precise actions, and adaptability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic arcade flight with precise controls.</p></li><li><p c